# TCLS r1: a sound page's keys audition; the X0X step editor is gone. On a 303's sound page with
# REC on, LFO + OCT used to write a tie and ENV + OCT a rest into the shared scratch pattern
# (mark_dirty). Nothing may change now: the step stays a rest and the project stays clean.
wait 300
cursor 1 0
tap EDIT
expect view 1
expect part 2
expect gate0.0 0
expect dirty 0
tap REC
expect rec 1
press LFO
tap OCT+
expect gate0.0 0
expect dirty 0
release LFO
press ENV
tap OCT-
expect gate0.0 0
expect dirty 0
release ENV
tap REC
expect rec 0
dump sound_oct_no_edit.json
